1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,320
An unseen passage of three hundred and fifty to four hundred and fifty words, and three sets of questions, five marks each.

2
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:13,697
Set A: true, false or not given, or filling gaps from the text.

3
00:00:13,697 --> 00:00:16,809
Set B: short answers in your own words.

4
00:00:16,809 --> 00:00:20,143
Set C: vocabulary in context.

5
00:00:20,143 --> 00:00:23,203
Fifteen marks, a fifth of the written paper.

